**A. PostgreSQL is the single source of truth**

All persistent business data must be stored in and retrieved from Cloud SQL for PostgreSQL through the secure backend.

**B. No business data in browser storage**

Never use localStorage, sessionStorage, IndexedDB, or browser-side mock repositories to persist real business data.

This includes products, variants, vendors, inventory, prices, customers, carts, orders, reservations, payments, delivery records, settings, discounts, audit logs, and any other business records.

**C. Preserve the existing UI**

Do not redesign, replace, rearrange, remove, or restyle existing screens, components, dashboards, forms, menus, layouts, navigation, product cards, or modals.

